==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the Master As only spawn after 40 seconds, it's entirely possible to cheese this stage by destroying the enemy base before they appear. [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] is useful for clearing the path to the base, and [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] can deal good damage to the base quickly. Spamming both alongside a few other rushers should be enough to beat this stage without even seeing the dual Master As. Otherwise, just use units that outrange Master A., such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] with a strong number of meatshields.

